From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] winsta: session queries on top of wtsapi32 (3560)

winsta: session queries on top of wtsapi32

WinStationEnumerateW (SESSIONIDW list), WinStationNameFromLogonIdA/W, LogonIdFromWinStationNameA/W,
WinStationFreeMemory, WinStationOpenServerA/W / CloseServer, WinStationIsHelpAssistantSession (never),
WinStationGetProcessSid (token user of the process, start time checked), WinStationDisconnect / Reset /
SendMessageA/W / TerminateProcess and the console notification registration are answered through
wtsapi32, so both DLLs report the same sessions. Unknown sessions give ERROR_CTX_WINSTATION_NOT_FOUND.
---
--- a/dlls/winsta/Makefile.in
+++ b/dlls/winsta/Makefile.in
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 MODULE    = winsta.dll
+IMPORTS   = wtsapi32 advapi32
 
 EXTRADLLFLAGS = -Wb,--prefer-native
 
